      "writtenOn": "2016-08-16T12:40:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I was worried about NFS and other such potentially blocking fs, but agree this is a bit scary for Put.\n\nBut isn\u0027t what I\u0027m already doing equivalent to the select in this specific case with:\n\n    if ctx.Err() !\u003d nil {\n        return\n    }\n\nIf the ctx was cancelled, Put will return without waiting for the goroutine to finish. But the goroutine won\u0027t replace the file because ctx.Err() is guaranteed to return non-nil in that case.",
